      "raw": "<p>I&#39;m a fan.</p><p>Thank you for simplifying effects that cross play area.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This still leaves timing based triggers and effects to order the cards entered play, so only reaction triggers are affected by this rule.</p><p>As for Hairtrigger and Fowl we&#39;ll have to see if they redid the wording on Fowl cards.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This is honestly how I&#39;ve been playing the game. &nbsp;I don&#39;t think it makes it drastically easier, just more fun and a bit faster.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>As for static effects vs. static effects, they won&#39;t fall under this rule as they don&#39;t have timing. &nbsp;The new ones overwrite the old just like always, at least I would assume that is how it works.</p>",
