      "created_at": "2013-11-04T19:58:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>@Christopher - Would you be able to give a quick clarification on what constitutes a \"simultaneous\" effect? It sure sounds like, from the ruling, \"would be dealt damage\" and \"dealt damage\" are being ruled as simultaneous effects to fall under the new Order of Operations.&nbsp;<span>Would \"static\" effects like Irradiated Vats and Imbued Fire (the damage type change) fall under simultaneous effects as well?</span></p>",
